        "TileImage": "$($repository c57ff780-011f-4fbd-89ee-f853d24111cc).Image",
        "Description": "47, I&apos;ll be brief.\r\rThis mission is quite cut and clear- Tyson Williams, Co-Owner of the notorious Haven Resort, has recently fallen on tough times. Tough times call for desperate measures. \rRecently, the Department of Employment signed a bill requiring a lump sum payment of 50k to hazardous condition workers. Killing them negates the law, a loophole Tyson plans to exploit. He wants to terminate the server staff, deemed by Williams as &quot;disloyal, good-for-nothing pigs.&quot;\r\rA contract is a contract.",
